From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: abhay-byte <abhay02delhi@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 13:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] panvk: commit gpu_prerast arenas up front on kbase

The regression bisects to beta.11: beta.10 passes, beta.11 fails, and
reverting patch 097 fixes it. Dropping only the alloc-on-fault flag from
the gpu_prerast arena allocation also fixes it, so keep 097's shared TLS
memory fix.

On MediaTek kbase (CSF 1.21), GPU-fault growth of these arenas loses the
first gpu_prerast draw's output. PanProbe gs_viewport_depth case A drew
nothing on every run with alloc-on-fault; without the flag, 6/6 runs pass.
Commit the arenas at creation using only the adjusted WB_MMAP flags.
This commits 160 MiB per VkDevice enabling GS/tess/XFB features; the
upgrade path is KBASE_IOCTL_MEM_COMMIT on first gpu_prerast use.

Purpose: restore the first gpu_prerast draw's output on kbase
Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC6 (Poco X6 Pro)
Tested Kbase UAPI: CSF 1.21 (MediaTek)
Mesa base range: 5a07217f034b (26.3.0-devel)
Validation test: PanProbe autorun (gs_viewport_depth A/B/C, vs_viewport_index, depth_bounds), CTS geometry/clipping/viewport + memory/sync

Generated-by: LLM
---

diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_device.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_device.c
index 6fd68e513f4..17b398789e8 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_device.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_device.c
@@ -131,17 +131,17 @@
 }
 
 #if PAN_ARCH >= 10
-/* Only GS, tessellation, XFB, polygon-mode and VS-store draws touch the
- * gpu_prerast arenas, and many apps (DXVK D3D9 games) never issue one.  Let
- * the kernel back them on GPU fault where it can, instead of committing and
- * zeroing 160 MiB per VkDevice up front.  The CPU only writes the header. */
+/* Commit the gpu_prerast arenas at creation.  On MediaTek kbase (CSF 1.21),
+ * GPU-fault growth loses the first gpu_prerast draw's output: PanProbe
+ * gs_viewport_depth case A drew nothing on every run; without alloc-on-fault,
+ * 6/6 runs pass.
+ * ponytail: commits 160 MiB per VkDevice enabling GS/tess/XFB features;
+ * upgrade path = KBASE_IOCTL_MEM_COMMIT on first gpu_prerast use. */
 static struct panvk_priv_mem
 alloc_gpu_prerast_arena(struct panvk_device *dev, uint64_t size)
 {
    uint32_t flags =
-      panvk_device_adjust_bo_flags(dev, PAN_KMOD_BO_FLAG_WB_MMAP) |
-      (dev->kmod.dev->props.supported_bo_flags &
-       PAN_KMOD_BO_FLAG_ALLOC_ON_FAULT);
+      panvk_device_adjust_bo_flags(dev, PAN_KMOD_BO_FLAG_WB_MMAP);
    struct panvk_priv_bo *bo;
 
    if (panvk_priv_bo_create(dev, size, flags, VK_SYSTEM_ALLOCATION_SCOPE_DEVICE,
